{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"She's a little startled to be seen. \"Mr. Mender! Great to see you....?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:45:01.751000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867341389796343818","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Good to talk to you.... do you like my little park?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:45:27.222000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867341496628936714","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I've always found it peaceful. Especially now. I assume you're aware of my er, condition?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:46:32.950000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867341772311756821","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"no longer one of those alive, unable to pass on?  Or is there some other condition?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:47:17.479000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867341959079919626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Yes, dead. That would be the one.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:47:42.970000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867342065997053952","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he smiles and shrugs \"Most of the best people I have known were dead.  Is that what brings you here.... being living impaired?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:48:27.215000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867342251575214172","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I just come here because it's nice. The city is always so busy, and this place is always so quiet. I like it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:50:41.654000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867342815452987392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he smiles \"thank you.... I've made better groves before.... but I tend to not want to repeat the look... and space in this city.... well there's not much\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:52:13.279000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867343199756746752","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he leans back against a tree \"I feel like too few people take the time to smell flowers\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:53:46.312000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867343589963726908","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"No one stops by to smell flowers because they're always afraid of losing time. I find it's the best part of my day.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:56:56.998000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867344389760483328","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"That's funny. This city. Before I came here, I found people were afraid to run out of time. Here, people seem to explore every possible way they can cut their clocks.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:58:15.904000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T09:59:55.994000Z","id":"867344720715186206","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he laughs \"The moment I was brought back.... I learned that people had confused Fool hearty for bravery\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T10:00:05.088000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867345178666336257","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he then side eyes Irynx \"How is it you time was cut short?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T10:01:36.067000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867345560260182047","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Ferrytown. We were planting these flowers that would keep the parks safe, since all the magic is being sapped out. It was, it was hard to breathe. We planted the flower and my lungs just... gave up, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T10:04:38.342000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867346324776550400","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he focuses on you \"that sounds like a rough way to go.... I hope the memory of that pain fades fast\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T10:06:55.806000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T10:07:04.232000Z","id":"867346901341569074","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I'm trying not to think about it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T10:07:31.985000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867347053087948840","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"He gets up and walks over to you.... and puts his hand in your shade.... and some of the pain of your death fades... almost like some time has passed \"That is the best I can do... but I hope it helps\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T10:10:00.788000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T10:10:13.003000Z","id":"867347677212311572","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"She feels lighter, a bit. \"It did help, thank you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T10:11:18.008000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867348001096990760","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he nods \"Sorry I didn't ask.... I am used to having to act quick to help people....\" he sighs \"war exacts a terrible price\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T10:12:04.380000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867348195596435476","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
